# liblouis: Russian mathematical Braille definitions
#
# This is a compatibility backport of the current Liblouis ru-math.uti input
# contract. Formatter-only extensions which have not yet entered upstream are
# identified below and do not override upstream character rules.
#
# Copyright (C) 2020-2022, 2025 Andrey Yakuboy <braille@yakuboy.ru>
# Copyright (C) 2026 Danil Kostenkov <danilkostenkov38@gmail.com>
